return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Ó tẹ ojula yii jade ní èdè kọọkan ti o yan, lori awọn adirẹsi wẹbu tirẹ, pẹlu awọn slug ti a tumọ, metadata, awọn akojọ aṣayan, awọn ọja WooCommerce, hreflang, awọn maapu ojula ti o jẹ ti èdè kọọkan ati llms.txt. Tumọ pẹlu ètò Zinn Digital® rẹ tabi pẹlu bọtini olupese tirẹ.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fipamọ́. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọpo rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o ba àlẹmọ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi ìlà kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ila yii kuro','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Àkópọ̀','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo plugin Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ko si asopọ ti o nilo fun plugin yii.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀ka ètò','Support'=>'Ìtìlẹ̀yìn','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àtúnṣe pamọ́','Tools'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ','Export settings'=>'Agbewọle awọn eto','Reset to defaults'=>'Tún sí aiyipada','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo ètò inú plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí padà sí ipò àkọ́kọ́ wọn. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àwọn ohun ìdánwò fún ìtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Gbe faili àwọn êtò wọlé','Import'=>'Wọlé','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a gbe wọ jade kò ní àwọn ọrọ aṣínírìí, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀ tabi àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rárá - o yoo nilo lati tun tẹ awọn wọnyẹn sii lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lórí plọọgìì yìí ti padà sí ipò àkọ́kọ́ rẹ̀.','Done.'=>'O ti se.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A kò le ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a gbe wọṣẹ láti inú plọọgìni Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìṣàgbéjáde àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kọ́ jẹ́ ìfiránṣẹ́ ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A fi fáìlì yẹn sọjade láti inú fífúnni (plugin) mìíràn (%s), nitorinaa títẹ́ sí ibi yẹn yoo fipamọ́ awọn ètò tí fífúnni yii kò mọ̀.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ètò ti wọlé. Awọn ọrọ igbaniوە ati awọn bọtini API ko si ninu igbejade, nitorina tẹ awọn wọnyẹn lẹẹkansi.','Translate'=>'Tumọ si','Manual overrides'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe ọwọ́','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Àwọn sitemap àti àwọn URL','Who pays for the translation'=>'Ta lo n sanwo fún ìtumọ̀ náà','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Tabili Zinn Digital® rẹ, tabi bọtini API tirẹ. Ko si ipele ọfẹ — ẹnikan n sanwo fun olupese fun gbogbo ọrọ.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Eto Zinn Digital® mi','My own provider key'=>'Bọtínì àṣírí ti mi','Site ID'=>'Àmì Ìdánimọ̀ Ojula','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Lati ori daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ, lori taabu Itumọ ti aaye yii.','Site token'=>'Àmì ojula','Provider'=>'Olupese','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Bọtìni rẹ, tí olùpèsè náà gba owó rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́ rẹ. Ó wa ní ìpamọ́ sori ojú abẹ́ ayélujára yìí wọ́n sì ń rán an sí wọn nìkan.','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ fún àwọn ohun èlò tí kò gbowó lórí tí ó sì ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.','This site is written in'=>'Aaye yii ni a kọ si','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Fi o fo si oju ogbofo lati lo ede aaye lati awọn eto WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Awọn ede lati tẹjade','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Olúkúlùkù ní àwọn àdírẹ́sì wẹ́bù tirẹ̀ àti maapu ojú-ewé tirẹ̀. Jẹ́ kí a tẹ̀jáde àwọn èdè tí o fẹ́ kí wọ́n wà nínú atọ́ka nìkan.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Máa túnra rẹ̀ ṣe láìnírò lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nígbà tí mo bá gbé e jáde tàbí tí mo bá ṣe é sí tuntun','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Ṣíṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé kan sàmí sí àwọn ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀ pé wọn kò lọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ mọ́ wọ́n sì ń tún wọn ṣe ní ẹ̀yìn. Ṣíṣe àtúnṣe láìyí ohùn kan pa dà kò ní owó kankan.','What gets translated'=>'Ohun tí a ń túmọ̀','Post types'=>'Àwọn irú ìfiṣé sílẹ̀','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Tún ṣe ìtumọ̀ àwọn àdírẹ́sì wẹ́bù náà pẹ̀lú','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Àwọn àlejò Faransé rí /fr/a-propos/ dípò /fr/about/. Àdírẹsì tí kò ní ìtumọ̀ náà máa ń bá a lọ láti máa ṣiṣẹ́, ó sì máa ń tún ọ̀nà ṣe, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tó ti wà nínú atọ́ka tó máa bàjẹ́.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Ṣe agbeyẹwo awọn akọle SEO, awọn apejuwe ati ọrọ alt aworan','Translate categories and tags'=>'Túmọ̀ àwọn ẹ̀ka àti àwọn tágì','Translate navigation menus'=>'Tumọ awọn akojọ aṣayan lilọ kiri','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Ṣe ìtumọ̀ àwọn ọjà ati àwọn àbùdá WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Àwọn àpèjúwe kúkúrú, àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ rrà, àwọn àmì ànímọ́ àti àwọn àpèjúwe ìyàtọ̀. A kì í fọwọ́ kàn ìnáwo, SKUs àti àwọn iye àṣàyàn tí a ti kó pamọ́ rárá.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Fi awọn taabu hreflang kun','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Ó sọ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí pé àwọn ojú ìwé yìí jẹ́ ojú ìwé kan náà ní àwọn èdè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀. Fi èyí sílẹ̀ àfi tí àlékún míràn bá ti ń ṣe é tẹ́lẹ̀.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Tẹ sitemap jade fun èdè kọọkan','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Gbe llms.txt jade fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Maapu pẹlẹ aniyan ti aaye naa ti awọn êngini idahun AI ka. Wọn ki le ma fi bẹẹ ranṣẹ JavaScript ati pe o le ma gba sitemap lailai.','Language switcher'=>'Olùyípadà èdè','Style'=>'Ara','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀, ààyè àti àwọn kọ̀ńńdà wà lórí àmúyẹ Ọ̀ṣọ́. Bó pẹ̀lú búlọ́ọ̀kì náà, shortcode [zinn_language_switcher], tàbí àtòjọ aṣàyàn.','Show only these languages'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn ede wọnyi nikan','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Fi iṣofo lati fi gbogbo ede ti o tẹjade han.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Sọ orúkọ èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan ní èdè rẹ̀','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch dipọ̀ mọ́ German. Ẹni tí kò lè ka ojú ewé yìí kò lè ka "German" náà.','Show flags'=>'Fi awọn àbámọ̀ hàn','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Pa kuro nipinlẹ: èdè kii ṣe orilẹ-ede, ati pe Arabic ati Spanish ko ni asia kan kan ti kii yọ ọpọlọpọ awọn agbọrọsọ wọn kuro.','Include the language being read'=>'Fi ede ti a n ka ninu un kun','Include the original language'=>'Fi ede atilẹba kun un','Add it to this menu'=>'Fi kún àkójọ àṣàyàn yìí','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Nikan ni akojọ aṣayan ti o sọ nibi. Ko si nkan ti a fi kun si eyikeyi akojọ aṣayan miiran lori aaye naa.','Accent'=>'Ohùn èdè','Background'=>'Ẹ̀yìn','Text'=>'Ọrọ','Corner radius'=>'Búburú igun','Spacing'=>'Ààyè Àlàfo','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Má fi kún àkójọ àṣàyàn kan','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Ṣatunkọ eyikeyi ìtumọ nibi. A máa ń tọ́jú ìtumọ̀ tí a ti ṣatunkọ rẹ gẹ́gẹ́ gangan bí o ṣe kọ ọ́, a ò sì ní kọ ẹ̀dà lórí rẹ̀ rò pé a tún tú ojú ewé náà.','Every language'=>'Gbogbo ede','Search translations'=>'Wá awọn ìtumọ̀','Filter'=>'Sẹ́lẹ̀','Content'=>'Akoonu','Language'=>'Èdè','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Status'=>'Ipò','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a ti tú sí èdè mìíràn. Ṣe àtẹ̀jáde èdè kan, ìtumọ̀ yóò sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ lẹ́yìn-ọ̀-iṣẹ́.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Awọn adirẹsi wọnyi wa L\'ori afẹfẹ. Ṣii eyikeyi ninu wọn lati ṣayẹwo rẹ, ki o si fi atọka sitemap silẹ si Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'A kò gba ọ láyè láti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn ìtumọ̀ lórí ojú ojuewé yìí.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Ṣíṣe àtúnṣe látọwọ́ rẹ — a pa mọ́','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Orísí ti yí padà — ao tun ṣe é','Up to date'=>'Wọn wà lójú àmọ́','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'Ń sopọ̀ lọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn nkan kan nilo akiyesi','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Nípa ṣíṣe lórí àkántì tirẹ̀','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Fliigi yii ko sọ idi rẹ. Fi ijabọ iwadii ranṣẹ si wa a o si ṣayẹwo rẹ.','Connection status'=>'Ipo asopọ','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A yẹ fi ojú wo ìgbẹ̀yìn ni %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí sí taabu tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èṣán yìí ránṣẹ́ sí ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tí ó sinmi. Àwọn ọrọ̀ aṣínà rẹ, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀ (tokens) àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àakọ sí pẹpẹ ìkojọpọ','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tíkẹ́tì àtìlẹ́yìn fún ọ, a sì dáhùn nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì. Bí o kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, da ẹ̀dà rẹ̀ sọ́kàn òkè kí o sì lẹ̀ mọ́ inú tíkẹ́tì fúnra rẹ.','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati sevha yii (%s). Da iroyin oke kọ silẹ ki o si ṣii tikẹti kan dipo — ko si ohun ti ko tọ si awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Àtìlẹyìn Zinn® ní ìròyìn rẹ — àmì ìtọ́kasí %s — yóò sì dáhùn nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti rán ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìjábọ̀ lọ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i — àwọn tó ṣáájú ti dé déédé.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ko le gba ijabọ naa ni bayi — iyẹn jẹ apakan wa, kii ṣe tirẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si laipẹ, tabi daakọ ijabọ ti o wa loke sinu tikẹti kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Wọ́n kọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ ìjábọ̀ náà (HTTP %d). Ṣe àwòkọ rẹ̀ sókè kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́tì kan, kí o sì fún wa ní nọ́mbà yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ni àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Awọn itọnisọna olumulo','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ìgbàlejò Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfmọ̀ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìdarí kan tí a kọ́ fún àwọn èèyàn tí wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ju ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn aye ọna asopọ ti o ti fi idi mulẹ, pẹlu owo ti o ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn aṣojú-ara-eniyan wakáàkiri agbaye: wín ìṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀ tó lé ní 10,000 láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹrẹ, onímọ̀ ẹ̀rọ àti àwọn onímọ̀ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n dọ̀gbá.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'A kọ́ bọ́ọ̀ sọ́ bọtìnì API náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó wà lọ́wọ́ báyìí àti pé o ní àǹfààní láti túmọ̀, lẹ́yìn náà fi pamọ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Olupese náà kọ̀ lórí owó tàbí ààyè. A kò tú ohunkohun sí èdè mìíràn. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìwọ̀n owó àti àwọn ààlà lórí àkántì rẹ pẹ̀lú wọn.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Olupese ìtumọ̀ náà ní ìṣòro ní apá wọn. Kò sí ohun tí a tú tàbí tí a gbówó lé lórí, yóò sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìkọjá tí ó kàn.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìtúmọ̀ náà kùnà, a sì kọ́ láti mọ ìdí tí ó fi rí bẹ́ẹ̀. Kò sí ohun tí a fipamọ́.','Sitemap index'=>'Atọka sitemap','%s sitemap'=>'%s sitemap','LLM content map'=>'Àwòrán àkóópọ̀ LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'%s Mápì àkóովá LLM','Languages published'=>'Àwọn èdè tí a tẹ̀ jáde','Site language'=>'Èdè ojula','SEO plugin'=>'Fọ́ọ̀mù ìsopọ̀ SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí olùpèsè ìtumọ̀ kankan tí a ti ṣètò.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Lẹẹ kọ bọtìnì API kan láti ọwọ́ olùpèsè tí o yàn, tàbí sọ ojú-wẹ̀bù náà pọ̀ mọ́ àkántì Zinn Digital® kan, yíyípadà èdè á bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní àyẹ̀wò tó tẹ̀ lé e.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Wi-Fi pẹ̀lú bọtínì %s tirẹ.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ si akọọlẹ Zinn Digital®, eyiti o dara - olupese rẹ gba owo lọwọ rẹ taara.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Ko ti sopọ mọ Zinn Digital® sibẹṣẹ.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Fi ID àti token ojula yìí kún láti inú daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ, tàbí kí o yípadà sí bọ́tìnì olùpèsè tirẹ̀ láìní akọọlẹnti kan ṣiṣẹ́.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'So mọ si Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Olupese ìtumọ̀ náà ní ìṣòro kan.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Àtúnsèèduró sí ìsìnkìí — olùpesè rẹ ni à̀ìní àkíyèsí.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ náà kò tíì déédéé.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Nǹkan kan tàṣìṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa.','Check their status page'=>'Ṣẹ̀wò ojú ìwé ipò wọn','Fix this on your account'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe èyí lórí àkáǹtì rẹ','Style preset'=>'Àṣàyàn àwòṣe ìrísí','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ibẹrẹ kan. Ohunkohun ti o wa ni isalẹ bori rẹ.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo awon awco ati iwọn temi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ki a si lo asayan naa gẹgẹ bi o ṣe wa gangan.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Aṣàyàn èdè Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Jẹ́ kí àwọn alábẹ̀wò ka ojú-ewé yìí ní èdè mìíràn.','Title'=>'Àkọlé','Use the plugin setting'=>'Lo eto amugbooro na','Dropdown'=>'Àlà kejì','Inline list'=>'Àtòjọ tó wà ní inú rẹ̀','Pills'=>'Awọn àpòòtọ́ dídì','Minimal text'=>'Ọrọ kékèré','Flags and names'=>'Àwọn àmì àti orúkọ','Stacked list'=>'Àkójọ tí a kó jọ','Choose a language'=>'Yan ede kan','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo awọn akọsilẹ ifilọlẹ Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbàlàwé tí a ṣe àgbéjọ rẹ̀ kùnà àyẹ̀wò òtítọ́ rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sílẹ̀.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Kò sí bọ́tìnnì àkọ́kọ́ ti DeepL API tí a ti fi pamọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi ṣe ìtumọ̀.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL kò ṣe ìtumọ̀ sí %s. Yan Google Gemini tàbí OpenAI fún èdè yìí, tàbí kí o so ojú-wọ́gbẹ̀ yìí pọ̀ mọ́ Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'A o le de ọdọ DeepL. Kò sí ohun tí a túmọ̀ àti pé kò sí ohun tí a gbowó lórí rẹ̀; yóò tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan si lori igbesẹ ti o tẹle.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Ìpín àwọn lẹ́tà DeepL rẹ ti tán fún àkókò yìí. Ìtumọ̀ yóò tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ nígbà tí ó bá tún bẹ̀rẹ̀, tàbí nígbà tí o bá gbé àlà kalẹ̀ sókè lórí àkántì DeepL rẹ.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL fèsì pẹ̀lú ohun kan tí a kò lè kà. Kò sí ohun tí a fi pamọ́.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Kò sí bọ́tìnnì àti kọ́kọ́rọ́ API ti Google Gemini tí a fi pamọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi ṣe ìtumọ̀.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Google Gemini kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀. Kò sí ohun tí a túmọ̀ àti kò sí ohun tí a gbówó lórí rẹ̀; yóò tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìkọjá tí ó kàn.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ko si bọtini OpenAI API ti a fipamọ, nitorina ko si ohun ti a le fi tumọ.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'A ko le kan si OpenAI. Ko si ohun ti a tumọ tabi ti a gba owo lori rẹ; yoo tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si ni ipele ti n bọ.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Ojula yìí kò ní ìsopọ̀ pẹ̀lú Zinn Digital®, nítorí náà kò sí ohun kankan láti kó jọ. Fi Site ID àti àmì wọlé, tàbí yí padà sí bọ́tìnnì olùpèsè rẹ.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ojula yi ko ni asopọ kankan pẹlu Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®. Kò sí ohun tí a rán; yóò tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìgbà tí ó kàn.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ìtumọ ti daduro lori aaye yii. Ṣayẹwo pe akọọlẹ naa wa ni imudojuiwọn lori dasibodu Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® kọ ami (token) aaye yii. Daakọ rẹ lẹẹkan si lati taabu Itumọ ti aaye naa lori dasibodu rẹ.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®. Aaye rẹ tẹ̀síwájú lati pese awọn itumọ ti o ti ni tẹlẹ.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® fèsì pẹ̀lú ohun kan tí a kò lè kà. Ojula rẹ ń bá a nìṣ láti pèsè àwọn ìtumọ̀ tó ti ní tẹ́lẹ̀.']];